== refusal
Ovenlight won't change this policy on its own:
  - acls rule 2 lets "autogroup:tagged" reach ["tag:monitoring:9100"]; a guest device may reach only its own app's node, on port 443
  - acls rule 3 lets "tag:ovenlight-guest-coach" reach ["*:*"]; a guest device may reach only its own app's node, on port 443

Suggested manual edit:
  If a rule above lets guest devices or unknown sources reach more, remove or narrow it.
  Then run the same ovenlight command again.
